            "title": "What is this for?",
            "content": "<p>These electrodes are intended for:<\/p><ul><li>Delivering microcurrent therapy to specific facial and neck areas.<br\/><\/li><li>Facilitating hands-free treatments when used with compatible accessories.<br\/><\/li><li>Enhancing the effectiveness of microcurrent sessions by ensuring consistent contact with the skin.<\/li><\/ul>",
